{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>想去日本滑雪又不想花時間折騰交通？越後湯澤絕對是最佳選擇！從東京出發僅需一小時車程，就能立刻置身於絕美雪景之中。這次行程特別挑選了新手友善的「岩原滑雪場」，場地寬闊且坡度平緩，配合專業教練指導，新手也能輕鬆體驗滑雪的樂趣。\n</p>\n<p>滑雪過後，當然要好好放鬆！入住溫泉旅館，浸個舒服的溫泉，徹底消除運動後的肌肉疲勞。最後一日還可以順道造訪日本三大峽谷之一的「清津峽」，欣賞超夢幻的水鏡倒影，絕對是大滿足的行程！</p>\n<p>留言「湯澤」，即刻 send 完整越後湯澤滑雪行程詳細資料比你！</p>\n<p>好動旅人 ｜ 旅遊不止食買玩，用跑步、潛水或滑雪等活動探索世界，在運動的節奏裡，發現每個地方最真實的風景。邊一場戶外旅程令你最難忘？即刻DM我哋分享你的冒險故事！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17928432545702400_8313386356adc9df739195.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17928432545702400_8313386356adc9df739195.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：@crystagramx)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/De33ih2vu2a/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%b2%a9%e5%8e%9f%e6%bb%91%e9%9b%aa%e5%a0%b4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">岩原滑雪場</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%97%a5%e6%9c%ac%e6%bb%91%e9%9b%aa/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">日本滑雪</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%b6%8a%e5%be%8c%e6%b9%af%e6%be%a4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">越後湯澤</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：@crystagramx資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/De33ih2vu2a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nOct 24 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T12:23:09.401856+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":473,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T12:00:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T13:38:26.078832+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T12:18:30.995040+00:00","content_hash":"ab9388abcb0fbe3f5deedcb9c3d24e21a57ea664a5dadd5b25e68f9c4a9da1ba","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}